  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are different. Most mandragorans do not have thorns, but you do, just as certain non-sentient plants do. You may use these thorns with your unarmed strikes to cause aggravating wounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mandragoran or Shenxue with plant-like aspect only.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your unarmed strikes inlict an additional +1 hp (lethal damage only) with each strike. This additional damage also applies each round to anyone grappling or grappled by you. If you have Defensive Unarmed Strike, Mighty Unarmed Strike, or the Unarmed Strike class ability, your unarmed strikes can be considered piercing attacks as well as blunt damage attacks.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc84\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
